{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Christian Giannangeli, CFP®: Wealth Manager in New York, NY | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/christian-giannangeli","about":{"@type":"Person","name":"Christian Giannangeli, CFP®","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/christian-giannangeli"},"isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6a3d5021dfad498418b16e1a_Christian%20Giannangeli.png"},"datePublished":"2026-06-30T17:25:20.588Z","dateModified":"2026-06-30T17:25:20.588Z","description":"Meet Christian Giannangeli, CFP®, Founder of Lockwood Private Wealth, helping executives, business owners, and families simplify financial complexity through personalized wealth planning."},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","name":"Christian Giannangeli","honorificSuffix":"CFP®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6a3d5021dfad498418b16e1a_Christian%20Giannangeli.png","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/christian-giannangeli","email":"mailto:christian.giannangeli@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"(917) 473-1216","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"New York","addressRegion":"NY","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"Before founding Lockwood Private Wealth, I advised clients at J.P. Morgan Private Bank, Merrill Lynch Wealth Management, and a billion-dollar independent wealth management firm. Those experiences reinforced a lesson I carry with me today: the greatest value an advisor provides is not simply managing investments, but helping clients make better decisions about their wealth.

As my clients' Personal Chief Financial Officer, I help oversee and coordinate all aspects of their financial lives. While investment management is a critical component of what I do, my role extends far beyond managing a portfolio. I help clients evaluate major financial decisions, coordinate with CPAs and estate attorneys, navigate equity compensation and business ownership complexities, optimize tax strategies, and ensure every piece of their financial life is working together toward their goals.
My goal is to be the first call clients make when an important financial opportunity, challenge, or life transition arises. By serving as a trusted advisor and Personal CFO, I help clients build, protect, and enjoy their wealth with greater clarity and confidence.","sameAs":["http://www.linkedin.com/in/christiangiannangeli"],"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"knowsAbout":["Financial Planning and Analysis","Investment Management","Tax Optimization","Equity Compensation"]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Christian Giannangeli, CFP®","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/christian-giannangeli"}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Lauren Lindsay, CFP®: Wealth Manager in Houston, TX | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/lauren-lindsay","about":{"@type":"Person","name":"Lauren Lindsay, CFP®","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/lauren-lindsay"},"isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6a147edb50fe2242b92baba4_Lindsay%20Lauren.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-06-24T14:08:19.897Z","dateModified":"2026-06-24T14:08:19.897Z","description":"CFP® with 28 years of experience helping clients navigate life's biggest transitions, Lauren Lindsay makes complex financial decisions clear, personal, and actionable."},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","name":"Lauren Lindsay","honorificSuffix":"CFP®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6a147edb50fe2242b92baba4_Lindsay%20Lauren.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/lauren-lindsay","email":"mailto:lauren.lindsay@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"(516) 234-7230","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Houston","addressRegion":"TX","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"Lauren Gadkowski Lindsay began her career as a fee-only financial planner in 1998 and has been a Certified Financial Planner® since 2001. She develops personalized strategies that reflect her clients’ goals and values across the country and internationally. Based in Houston, Texas, Lauren has worked virtually with clients since 2008, blending accessibility with highly personalized service. A former English teacher, she’s skilled at making complex financial topics clear and actionable.

Lauren is passionate about helping clients reach their goals through flexible, customized plans that adapt as life evolves. At Paragon, she focuses on building tailored solutions and guiding clients toward lasting success.

Lauren lives in Houston’s Woodland Heights with her husband, daughter, and St. Bernard. She’s active in her community as a school volunteer, Girl Scout leader, and contributor to the Houston Heights Women’s Club. Her life reflects a deep commitment to family, clients, and service.","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/lauren-lindsay-cfp-%C2%AE-3236484/"],"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Financial Planning & Analysis","Planning for women"]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Lauren Lindsay, CFP®","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/lauren-lindsay"}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Allen Buckley, CFP®: Wealth Manager in Franklin, TN | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/allen-buckley","about":{"@type":"Person","name":"Allen Buckley, CFP®","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/allen-buckley"},"isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69f1e5e061b5ed79c60439f3_Allen%20B%20Hero%20(1).webp"},"datePublished":"2026-06-24T14:12:54.529Z","dateModified":"2026-06-24T14:12:54.529Z","description":"CFP® with over two decades of experience serving high-net-worth families, Allen Buckley delivers deeply personalized wealth management tailored to each client's goals and circumstances."},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","name":"Allen Buckley","honorificSuffix":"CFP®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69f1e5e061b5ed79c60439f3_Allen%20B%20Hero%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/allen-buckley","email":"mailto:allen.buckley@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"(516) 323-1048","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Franklin","addressRegion":"TN","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"Allen Buckley has over two decades of experience in finance serving the unique needs of high net-worth and ultra high net-worth families. As a Certified Financial Planner®, he specializes in helping clients achieve their financial goals, tailored to their individual circumstances and aspirations.

As a former Vice President in personal financial management at one of the world’s leading investment banks, Allen gained invaluable insights into managing wealth for discerning clients. During his tenure at Goldman Sachs, Allen worked with individual clients and families, helped them navigate complex financial landscapes and tailored financial solutions to their specific needs.

Beyond his professional pursuits, Allen finds joy in his family life alongside his wife, Crystal, and their children, Ella, Ava, and Luke. Together, they call Thompson’s Station, TN home and enjoy boating and various outdoor activities. His dedication to family, clients and his community define his career as a trusted advisor.","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/allenbuckleyvwi/"],"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Financial Planning","Tax Optimization","Investment Management","Succession Planning"]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Allen Buckley, CFP®","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/allen-buckley"}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"name":"Savvy Wealth","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"datePublished":"2026-04-29T16:29:31.859Z","primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69ea60407beb2be3aa112812_Lindsey%20L%20SEO.webp"},"@type":"WebPage","about":{"name":"Lindsey Lewis, MBA, ChFC®, CFP®","@type":"Person","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/lindsey-lewis"},"name":"Lindsey Lewis, MBA, ChFC®, CFP®: Financial Advisor in Park City and Salt Lake City, UT | Savvy Wealth","description":"Financial advisor Lindsey Lewis of Blue Barn Wealth helps high-net-worth individuals, entrepreneurs, and athletes simplify complex finances with personalized planning, tax strategies, and investment management.","dateModified":"2026-04-29T16:29:31.859Z","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/lindsey-lewis"},{"contactPoint":[{"contactType":"Customer Service","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","areaServed":"US","@type":"ContactPoint","availableLanguage":["English"]}],"@type":"Organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"]},{"image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69ea603f3480eb13a570971b_Lindsey%20L%20Hero%20(1).webp","address":{"addressCountry":"US","addressLocality":"Park City and Salt Lake City","addressRegion":"UT","@type":"PostalAddress"},"knowsAbout":["Financial Planning & Analysis","Tax Optimization","Alternative Investing","​​Investment Management"],"worksFor":{"name":"Savvy Wealth","@type":"Organization","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"@type":"Person","jobTitle":"Financial Advisor","description":"Lindsey Lewis, MBA, ChFC®, CFP®, is a Park City-based financial advisor with Blue Barn Wealth, known for helping clients simplify complex financial lives and make confident decisions through moments that matter most. She works with high-net-worth individuals and families, entrepreneurs, and professional athletes, guiding them through growth, success, and transition with clarity, structure, and intention.

In addition to her advisory work, Lindsey serves as Managing Director at The American College of Financial Services, where she is focused on shaping the future of financial advice and developing the next generation of professionals. She also contributes to Advisor Launch Lab, supporting the development of advisors as they build and grow their practices. Her work has earned national recognition, including InvestmentNews Hot List in 2025 and 2023, as well as the InvestmentNews Trailblazer Award and other industry honors recognizing her impact on the profession.

Outside of her professional work, Lindsey brings the same level of energy and intention to her personal life. She is a mom of two, a yoga teacher, and someone who prioritizes strength, movement, and balance, values that carry through to how she approaches both life and wealth.","telephone":"(801) 871-8710","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/lindsey-lewis","honorificSuffix":"MBA, ChFC®, CFP®","name":"Lindsey Lewis","email":"mailto:lindsey@bluebarnwealth.com","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/lindseycarolyn/"]},{"itemListElement":[{"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com","position":1,"@type":"ListItem"},{"name":"Lindsey Lewis","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/lindsey-lewis","position":2,"@type":"ListItem"}],"@type":"BreadcrumbList"},{"mainEntity":[{"name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I started my career at the intersection of women and money, after seeing how transformative financial confidence can be. That work gave me a deep understanding of how people think, feel, and make decisions about money. Over time, that foundation expanded into a broader advisory practice where I now work with individuals and families navigating complexity, growth, and transition. The common thread has always been helping clients make informed decisions, simplify complexity, and move forward with confidence."}},{"name":"What types of clients do you work with?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with high-net-worth individuals and families, entrepreneurs, and professional athletes who are navigating growth, success, or meaningful life transitions. Many of my clients are balancing multiple priorities and looking for a trusted partner to help them simplify decisions and think strategically about their financial lives. While my career began with a focus on women, that perspective continues to inform how I approach advice today, bringing a more thoughtful, relationship-driven experience to a broader range of clients."}},{"name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I take an integrated, experience-driven approach to financial planning. That means going beyond transactions and helping clients think through how their financial decisions connect to their life, priorities, and long-term vision. My background at the intersection of women and money shaped how I communicate and guide decisions, and today that perspective allows me to simplify complex situations and help clients move forward with clarity and confidence."}},{"name":"Working with Savvy","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Working with Savvy allows me to combine personalized advice with modern technology and infrastructure. It creates a more seamless and efficient client experience while keeping the focus where it belongs on thoughtful planning, strong relationships, and long-term outcomes."}},{"name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My work centers on comprehensive financial planning, investment strategy, and helping clients navigate complex financial decisions with clarity. I focus on connecting all aspects of a client’s financial life so each decision supports a cohesive, long-term strategy. In addition to my client work, I bring industry leadership experience focused on advisor development, evolving client needs, and the future of financial advice."}},{"name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients with a wide range of planning needs, including investment strategy, retirement planning, and structuring their financial lives in a more intentional and organized way. Many of the conversations I guide are tied to pivotal moments such as business growth, liquidity events, or life transitions like divorce. My role is to simplify those decisions, bring structure to the process, and ensure each step aligns with a broader long-term plan."}},{"name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My favorite part is seeing the shift that happens when clarity replaces uncertainty. When clients understand their options and begin making decisions with confidence and intention, it changes not just their financial lives, but how they show up in other areas as well. Being part of that process is incredibly meaningful."}}],"@type":"FAQPage"}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jacob-ray/#webpage","name":"Jacob Ray, AWMA®, AIF®: Wealth Manager in Denver, CO | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jacob-ray","description":"Webpage with info on Jacob Ray, wealth manager at Savvy.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/696fc09e1be151bd75fbebad_Jacob%20R%20Hero%20(1)-p-500.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-01-29T16:04:21.363Z","dateModified":"2026-01-29T16:04:21.363Z"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jacob-ray/#person","name":"Jacob Ray","honorificSuffix":"AWMA®, AIF®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/696fc09e1be151bd75fbebad_Jacob%20R%20Hero%20(1)-p-500.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jacob-ray","email":"mailto:jray@coloradowealthgroup.com","telephone":"+1-720-729-2504","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Denver","addressRegion":"CO","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/jacobray7/"],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Financial Planning & Analysis","Income Planning"],"description":"Jacob brings over a decade of experience in the financial services industry to his role at Colorado Wealth Group. He holds a Bachelor’s degree in Business Administration from the University of Northern Colorado and an MBA from Western Kentucky University.

Jacob’s professional designations include Accredited Wealth Management Advisor (AWMA®) and Accredited Investment Fiduciary (AIF®). These credentials, combined with his experience, support comprehensive, tailored financial planning and investment guidance for each client’s unique situation.

Outside of work, Jacob enjoys spending time with his wife, Leanne, and their children. They love exploring Colorado’s outdoors, trying new restaurants and breweries, and spending time with family and friends."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Jacob Ray","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jacob-ray"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I’ve always been drawn to helping people make informed, confident financial decisions. Over the past decade in financial services, I’ve focused on building the skills and experience necessary to guide clients through complex financial landscapes and help them achieve their goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with individuals, families, and business owners who want comprehensive, strategic planning that accounts for their unique financial circumstances, including retirement, stock option divestitures, and education planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My expertise lies in financial planning and investment management, with an emphasis on retirement planning, cash flow analysis, risk management, and company stock/divestiture strategies. I focus on helping clients integrate all aspects of their financial lives into one cohesive plan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients develop strategies for retirement planning, cash flow management, company stock option divestitures, tax-efficient wealth management, and education planning. Each plan is tailored to the client’s goals and circumstances."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I bring a combination of attention to detail, critical insight, and practical guidance to every client relationship. My approach is collaborative and transparent, helping clients understand their options, feel confident in their decisions, and stay on track toward their goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I enjoy helping clients see the big picture come together. Watching a plan take shape and knowing it provides clarity and peace of mind is the most rewarding part of my work. I value building long-term relationships and being a trusted partner through all of life’s financial milestones."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Savvy’s platform enables our team at Colorado Wealth Group to provide high-touch, fiduciary-focused service with the support of modern, integrated technology. The collaborative tools and real-time dashboards allow us to focus on strategy, insight, and personalized guidance—so clients can see and understand their full financial picture in one place."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/elijah-pell/#webpage","name":"Elijah Pell, AAMS®, CEPA: Wealth Manager in Waterbury, VT | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/elijah-pell","description":"Elijah Pell, AAMS®, CEPA is a wealth manager at Savvy Wealth who helps individuals, families, and business owners make confident financial decisions through education-driven, tax-aware planning and long-term partnership.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/68dbfff07bb1e7b0ee188d92_Elijah%20Pell%20Hero%20(1).webp"},"datePublished":"2025-12-19T02:20:41.111Z","dateModified":"2025-12-19T02:20:41.111Z"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/elijah-pell/#person","name":"Elijah Pell","honorificSuffix":"AAMS®, CEPA","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/68dbfff07bb1e7b0ee188d92_Elijah%20Pell%20Hero%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/elijah-pell","email":"mailto:elijah.pell@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"+1-802-214-1832","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Waterbury","addressRegion":"VT","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/elijahpell/"],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Tax Optimization","Legacy & Charitable Planning","Financial Planning"],"description":"Elijah brings over eight years of experience in comprehensive financial planning, grounded in a background in accounting, analytics, mutual fund research, and private equity. Early in his career, his work in investment analytics provided deep exposure to markets and portfolio construction—but witnessing the real-world impact of poor financial planning on families shaped his purpose.

Today, Elijah focuses on people over portfolios. His approach emphasizes education, clarity, and trust, helping clients build confidence in their financial decisions. He works closely with retirees and those transitioning into retirement, business owners, and high-income individuals, offering guidance across retirement income planning, tax-aware investing, risk management, business exit strategies, legacy planning, and charitable giving.

Elijah is known for tailoring recommendations to each client’s comfort level, pacing, and decision style—prioritizing understanding and long-term partnership over complexity."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Elijah Pell","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/elijah-pell"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"After earning a degree in accounting, I began my career in mutual fund analytics and later worked as an analyst in private equity. While the work gave me a strong understanding of markets and investing, witnessing the impact of poor financial planning on families made it clear that I wanted to directly help people. That realization led me into personal financial planning, where I could apply my analytical background to make a meaningful difference in clients’ lives."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I primarily work with retirees and individuals transitioning into retirement who need income distribution planning, Social Security timing guidance, cash flow management, and risk management. I also work with business owners and high-income individuals seeking tax-aware strategies, non-qualified investment management, and coordinated financial planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I specialize in tax-efficient investing for non-qualified brokerage accounts, including asset location strategy, gain and loss harvesting, liquidity planning, and portfolio construction designed to support long-term goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My primary focus is comprehensive retirement income planning—strategically sequencing withdrawals from taxable, tax-deferred, and Roth accounts, minimizing taxes, and coordinating Required Minimum Distributions (RMDs)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I start by deeply understanding each client’s goals, concerns, family dynamics, and decision-making style. I adapt both the pacing and complexity of recommendations to ensure clarity and confidence, building trust through education and thoughtful guidance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Building long-term relationships and supporting clients through life’s milestones is what I value most. Seeing plans come together and providing steady guidance through challenges brings real meaning to my work."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Savvy’s collaborative environment and efficient technology reduce administrative friction and allow me to spend more time focused on planning and client relationships, which ultimately leads to better outcomes."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/nathan-mirizzi/#webpage","name":"Nathan Mirizzi, CFP®: Wealth Manager in Salt Lake City, UT | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/nathan-mirizzi","description":"Nathan Mirizzi, CFP® is an Associate Advisor at Blue Barn Wealth helping individuals and families build financial clarity through planning, investment strategy, and guidance.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a09fc4420546bb478005bb_ebf266926da5edb37b61a9d81d034fb2_Nathan%20M%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-03-09T16:56:38.180Z","dateModified":"2026-03-09T16:56:38.180Z","about":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/nathan-mirizzi/#person","name":"Nathan Mirizzi","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/nathan-mirizzi"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/nathan-mirizzi/#person","name":"Nathan Mirizzi","honorificSuffix":"CFP®","jobTitle":"Associate Advisor","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a09fc4972a96454bb7aa96_Nathan%20M%20Hero%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/nathan-mirizzi","email":"mailto:nathan@bluebarnwealth.com","telephone":"+1-801-797-0497","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Salt Lake City","addressRegion":"UT","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/nathan-mirizzi/"],"knowsAbout":["Financial Planning & Analysis","Tax Optimization","Alternative Investing","Investment Management"],"description":"Nathan Mirizzi is an Associate Advisor at Blue Barn Wealth and a CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER® professional. He graduated from California Polytechnic State University, San Luis Obispo, in 2022 with a Bachelor’s Degree in Business Administration, concentrating in Financial Management and Accounting.

Nathan is passionate about personal finance and is dedicated to helping individuals thoughtfully navigate their financial journeys. He approaches both his professional and personal life with enthusiasm and initiative, guided by the motto “Engage in life.”

Outside of work, Nathan enjoys outdoor activities including hiking, camping, skiing, hunting, and fishing, as well as spending quality time with family and friends."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Nathan Mirizzi","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/nathan-mirizzi"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I’ve always known I wanted to build a career in personal finance because of the real impact it has on people’s everyday lives. While studying financial management and accounting, that direction became even clearer to me. I realized I didn’t just want to understand the numbers—I wanted to work directly with individuals, helping them feel more confident and in control of their financial decisions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with individuals and families who want to build a strong financial foundation and be intentional about where their wealth can take them. Many clients are navigating increasing complexity—whether that’s investments, career, income, taxes, family planning, or long-term legacy goals—and are looking for clarity, structure, and thoughtful strategy."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My background includes financial planning fundamentals, investment strategy, and financial analysis. I focus on helping clients understand their options and make disciplined, informed decisions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We offer a comprehensive planning process built around key areas such as financial planning, investment management, tax planning, estate planning, and charitable giving. The goal is to help clients make confident decisions across all parts of their financial life, not just one piece at a time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I bring a high level of energy and attention to detail to every client relationship. I believe strong financial planning starts with engagement—understanding each client’s goals and building a strategy that supports them over time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Helping clients gain confidence in their financial decisions. When someone feels clear about their plan and empowered to move forward, that’s incredibly rewarding."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Working with Savvy enhances the tools and operational support behind the scenes, allowing our team to deliver a seamless and modern client experience. The platform enables us to focus on thoughtful planning, strong communication, and long-term financial success for the families we serve."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/bruce-larsen/#webpage","name":"Bruce Larsen, CEP®, NSSA®, EA: Wealth Manager in Denver, CO | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/bruce-larsen","description":"Webpage with info on Bruce Larsen, wealth manager at Savvy.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6970b4b30338ee01bac7f48c_Bruce%20Larsen%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-01-29T16:12:03.269Z","dateModified":"2026-01-29T16:12:03.269Z"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/bruce-larsen/#person","name":"Bruce Larsen","honorificSuffix":"CEP®, NSSA®, EA","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/696fd8cd17cb6fbf43c77f58_Bruce%20L%20Hero%20(1)-p-500.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/bruce-larsen","email":"mailto:blarsen@coloradowealthgroup.com","telephone":"+1-720-729-2078","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Denver","addressRegion":"CO","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/bruce-larsen-54392530a/"],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Financial Planning","Estate & Trust Planning"],"description":"Bruce Larsen has been in the financial services industry for over 30 years. He began his career after graduating from the University of Wyoming in 1988 with a BS in Accounting, spending nearly a decade in accounting, including time as a corporate CFO. In 2020, Bruce brought his practice to Colorado Wealth Group to expand his ability to collaborate, mentor, and continue his passion for helping clients organize and understand their financial lives.

Over the years, his practice has evolved to take a multi-generational approach, working with clients and their families across different life stages. He has written a book on taxes and holds the Certified Estate Planner™ (CEP®) designation, focusing on estate planning essentials such as living trusts, estate taxes, and disability or special needs planning. Bruce is also an Enrolled Agent (EA), licensed to represent clients before the IRS.

Bruce grew up on a cattle ranch in Wyoming and has made Colorado his home with his wife, Cindy, since 2008. They have two grown children. Outside of work, Bruce trains horses and participates in team roping events."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Bruce Larsen","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/bruce-larsen"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My career began in accounting, eventually leading to a corporate CFO role. Over time, I found myself wanting to work more directly with individuals and families, helping them make sense of their finances in a way that felt accessible and personal. That desire prompted my transition into financial advising, where retirement and tax planning became central parts of my work."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I primarily work with people who are at or nearing retirement. Many are preparing for major financial transitions, evaluating their income needs, or working through estate and legacy considerations. I also collaborate with families across generations, helping them stay organized and aligned as their circumstances evolve."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My background includes tax planning, estate planning, and retirement planning. These areas often overlap, and I enjoy helping clients understand how decisions in one area influence the others. My training as a CEP® and my work as an Enrolled Agent contribute to the technical foundation I bring to each relationship."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I assist clients with Social Security filing considerations, tax-aware planning, retirement income planning, and estate and trust planning. These strategies are guided by a client’s goals, family structure, and long-term needs, and I take a holistic look at how each piece fits into the broader picture."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I tend to start with taxes. It often provides a useful framework for understanding someone’s overall situation, and it helps reveal opportunities or considerations that might otherwise be overlooked. That tax-first perspective has been part of my approach since the beginning of my work in financial planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I enjoy catching up with clients and learning how their lives and priorities are evolving. Those conversations help shape the guidance I provide and strengthen long-term relationships. Seeing clients gain clarity and a stronger sense of direction is one of the most rewarding parts of this work."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I appreciate the high level of support Savvy provides — from technology to operational resources — which helps create a smoother experience for both advisors and clients."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/steven-harp/#webpage","name":"Steven Harp, CFP®, ChFC®, CLU®, AIF®, and CLTC®: Wealth Manager in Denver, CO | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/steven-harp","description":"Webpage with info on Steven Harp, wealth manager at Savvy.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/696fc0a0ff97df075038395e_Steven%20H%20Hero%20(1)-p-500.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-01-29T15:56:25.702Z","dateModified":"2026-01-29T15:56:25.702Z"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/steven-harp/#person","name":"Steven Harp","honorificSuffix":"CFP®, ChFC®, CLU®, AIF®, and CLTC®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/696fc0a0ff97df075038395e_Steven%20H%20Hero%20(1)-p-500.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/steven-harp","email":"mailto:sharp@coloradowealthgroup.com","telephone":"+1-720-729-2501","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Denver","addressRegion":"CO","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/stevenharp/"],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Financial Planning","Tax Optimization","Investment Management"],"description":"Steven Harp is the Founder and Chief Executive Officer of Colorado Wealth Group. He graduated from the University of Missouri in 2004 and has since built an advisory practice grounded in fiduciary responsibility, education, and personalized service.

Steven is a CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER® professional and holds several advanced industry designations, including ChFC®, CLU®, AIF®, and CLTC®. These credentials support comprehensive guidance across investments, retirement planning, tax planning, insurance, estate considerations, and long-term care strategies.

In addition to serving clients, Steven is passionate about continuing education and mentoring, helping develop advisors within Colorado Wealth Group to ensure consistent, high-quality client experiences."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Steven Harp","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/steven-harp"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I graduated from the University of Missouri in 2004 and began my career with a strong interest in helping people make confident, informed financial decisions. Over time, that interest evolved into a passion for comprehensive financial planning and fiduciary advice. Building Colorado Wealth Group has allowed me to combine that passion with a commitment to education, leadership, and long-term client relationships."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with individuals and families who want a thoughtful, personalized approach to managing their wealth. Many of my clients value long-term planning, proactive guidance, and a trusted advisor who can help them navigate life transitions with clarity and confidence."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My expertise lies in comprehensive financial planning, including investment management, retirement planning, risk management, estate considerations, and long-term care planning. I take a holistic view of each client’s financial life to ensure every decision works together toward their goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients develop strategies focused on long-term financial security—retirement income planning, investment allocation, insurance and risk management, and planning for healthcare and long-term care needs. Every strategy is customized to reflect each client’s priorities and circumstances."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As a fiduciary, my approach is centered on objectivity, education, and personalization. I believe financial planning should be transparent and collaborative. Clients should understand their options, feel confident in their decisions, and know their advisor is always acting in their best interest."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Savvy’s platform supports the high-touch, fiduciary-focused service model we value at Colorado Wealth Group. Its modern technology, collaborative resources, and integrated planning tools allow us to deliver a seamless client experience while keeping the focus on clients’ goals."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jennifer-gugliemotto/#webpage","name":"Jennifer Gugliemotto: Wealth Manager in Columbus, OH | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jennifer-gugliemotto","description":"Jennifer Gugliemotto is a wealth manager at Savvy Wealth who helps individuals and business owners navigate life transitions with clarity, empathy, and purpose. Her work focuses on financial planning, legacy considerations, risk management, and charitable strategies.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/691457b79ccfff7c6eccc537_Jeniffer%20G%20Hero%20(3).webp"},"datePublished":"2025-12-19T02:15:23.812Z","dateModified":"2025-12-19T02:15:23.812Z"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jennifer-gugliemotto/#person","name":"Jennifer Gugliemotto","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/691457b79ccfff7c6eccc537_Jeniffer%20G%20Hero%20(3).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jennifer-gugliemotto","email":"mailto:jennifer.gugliemotto@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"+1-614-733-8835","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Columbus","addressRegion":"OH","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/jennifer-gugliemotto-carl-9598709/"],"knowsAbout":["Financial Planning","Estate & Trust Planning","Risk Management","Legacy & Charitable Planning"],"description":"Jennifer transitioned into financial planning after a profound personal loss reshaped her sense of purpose. Following a 12-year career as a global corporate retail designer, she redirected her creative and analytical skills toward helping others navigate grief, legacy, and complex financial decisions with clarity and compassion.

With seven years of experience in financial planning, including roles at Edward Jones and Huntington Bank, Jennifer now serves clients nationwide through Savvy’s tech-forward, client-centric platform. Her approach emphasizes deep listening, empathy, and flexible engagement—combining in-person and digital collaboration.

Jennifer is actively involved with 4-H, the Columbus Museum of Art’s fundraising initiatives, and alumni organizations for DAAP and Walnut Hills High School. Outside of work, she prioritizes balance, community connection, and continued personal growth."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Jennifer Gugliemotto","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jennifer-gugliemotto"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The pivot point in my career came when my best friend, Ruth, passed away from colon cancer at the age of 32. That loss reshaped my purpose and ultimately led me to financial planning as a way to support others through life’s most difficult transitions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with individual investors and business owners, helping them gain clarity, control, and peace of mind as they navigate pivotal life changes."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My work spans comprehensive financial planning, retirement readiness, estate and charitable planning, risk management, and strategies designed to protect and distribute assets in alignment with each client’s unique life path."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients create clarity and fill in the gaps by listening deeply and meeting them where they are. My goal is to add structure, awareness, and long-term guidance through all of life’s transitions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My approach is approachable, open-minded, and deeply attentive. I partner with clients in a way that respects their individual needs and emotional context."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Getting to know their prismatic, multi-dimensional selves."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Savvy’s technology-forward approach aligns with what many of my clients have long wanted. The firm values people, perspective, and innovation, and its vision reflects the future of finance in a digital world."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/justin-ericksen/#webpage","name":"Justin Ericksen, CFP®, CFA, AFC®: Wealth Manager in Orem, UT | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/justin-ericksen","description":"Justin Ericksen, CFP®, CFA, AFC® is an advisor at Blue Barn Wealth helping individuals and families build financial clarity through planning, investment strategy, and wealth management.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a09c2f5e0d8e02864de9ce_2f46bc32b28e461dcfef00304583efaa_Justin%20E%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-03-09T16:51:31.884Z","dateModified":"2026-03-09T16:51:31.884Z","about":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/justin-ericksen/#person","name":"Justin Ericksen","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/justin-ericksen"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/justin-ericksen/#person","name":"Justin Ericksen","honorificSuffix":"CFP®, CFA, AFC®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a09c2ec8c56e2e73abe551_Justin%20E%20Hero%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/justin-ericksen","email":"mailto:justin@bluebarnwealth.com","telephone":"+1-801-797-1947","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Orem","addressRegion":"UT","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/justin-ericksen-ms-cfp%C2%AE-cfa-afc%C2%AE-492b1216b/"],"knowsAbout":["Financial Planning & Analysis","Alternative Investing","Tax Optimization","Investment Management"],"description":"Justin Ericksen is an Advisor at Blue Barn Wealth and a CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER® professional. He also holds the Chartered Financial Analyst designation and earned a master’s degree in Financial Planning and Analytics from Utah Valley University.

Justin is passionate about finance and helping individuals succeed. He believes the most important things in life are spending time with the people you love and enriching the lives of others. His planning philosophy reflects those values—helping clients build financial strategies that support what matters most to them.

Outside of work, Justin enjoys spending time with his wife and siblings. His favorite activities include tennis, snowboarding, singing, and playing board games. Justin, his wife, and their dog live in Fairview, Utah."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Justin Ericksen","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/justin-ericksen"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I’ve always been drawn to finance and the role it plays in shaping people’s lives. I pursued formal education in financial planning and analytics and earned both the CFP® and CFA designations to provide clients with comprehensive, disciplined guidance. I wanted a career where I could help people succeed and make confident decisions about their future."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with individuals and families who want clarity around their financial direction—whether that’s building wealth, planning for retirement, managing investments, or navigating life transitions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My background includes comprehensive financial planning, investment management, and long-term wealth strategy. I focus on aligning investment decisions with a broader financial plan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients develop personalized investment strategies, retirement plans, tax-aware planning approaches, and coordinated financial strategies designed to support their long-term goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Holding both the CFP® and CFA designations allows me to approach planning from both a holistic and analytical perspective. I believe strong financial decisions require both a thoughtful plan and disciplined execution."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Helping clients gain confidence in their financial decisions. When someone feels clear and steady about their financial future, it allows them to focus more fully on the parts of life that matter most."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Partnering with Savvy enhances the tools and support behind the scenes, allowing us to operate more efficiently and deliver a higher level of client service. The additional technology and operational platform enable us to focus even more on thoughtful planning and investment management for the families we serve."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jeff-brimhall/#webpage","name":"Jeff Brimhall, PhD, CFP®, CFA: Managing Partner / Wealth Manager in Orem, UT | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jeff-brimhall","description":"Jeff Brimhall, PhD, CFP®, CFA is a Managing Partner at Blue Barn Wealth helping individuals and families simplify financial complexity through planning, tax strategy, and investment management.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a09989eafb8544f9e9343d_60980ede3d654a819c963cb4d5473799_Jeff%20B%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-03-09T16:39:44.375Z","dateModified":"2026-03-09T16:39:44.375Z","about":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jeff-brimhall/#person","name":"Jeff Brimhall","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jeff-brimhall"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jeff-brimhall/#person","name":"Jeff Brimhall","honorificSuffix":"PhD, CFP®, CFA","jobTitle":"Managing Partner / Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a099805c8ea40ba46bad1d_Jeff%20B%20Hero%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jeff-brimhall","email":"mailto:jeff@bluebarnwealth.com","telephone":"+1-801-797-1949","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Orem","addressRegion":"UT","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/jefftbrimhall/"],"knowsAbout":["Financial Planning & Analysis","Tax Optimization","Alternative Investing","Investment Management"],"description":"Jeff Brimhall is a managing partner at Blue Barn Wealth, where he enjoys working with clients to simplify their life and master their finances. Prior to Blue Barn Wealth, Jeff served as a Senior Advisor at Soltis Investment Advisors and acted as interim CEO of Ampelis, a corporate and family consulting company focused on successful transitions of culture and assets between generations.

Earlier in his career, Jeff was an award-winning faculty member in Finance and Economics at Case Western Reserve University, an equity analyst in National City Bank’s Private Client Group, and held analyst and advisory roles at Lee Financial, a Registered Investment Advisor in Dallas, TX, and Crow Holdings.

Jeff earned a PhD in Economics from Southern Methodist University and a B.S. in Civil and Environmental Engineering from Brigham Young University. He is a CERTIFIED FINANCIAL PLANNER® professional and holds the Chartered Financial Analyst designation. Jeff has also served as Chairman of the Utah Chapter of the Financial Planning Association and taught in the Personal Financial Planning Program at Utah Valley University."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Jeff Brimhall","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jeff-brimhall"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I wanted a career that truly made a difference in how people live their lives. My path started as an engineer where I realized I wanted to have a more personal impact on people’s lives, which led me to economics and finance, including work in academia and investment analysis. Over time I became more drawn to helping individuals and families apply these principles in real life. Financial planning gave me the opportunity to combine strategy and relationships in a way that helps people make better decisions and live more intentionally."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My ideal clients are individuals and families who want to use their wealth to make their life, family, community, and the world better. Many are navigating growing complexity—whether that’s investments, career income, taxes, family planning, or long-term legacy goals—and want clarity and structure."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My background includes investments, financial planning, tax planning, charitable giving, legacy planning, and alternative investments. I also work with clients who want a more comprehensive approach—where planning, investments, and long-term goals all fit together."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We offer a comprehensive planning process built around key areas such as financial planning, investment management, tax planning, estate planning, and charitable giving. The goal is to help clients make confident decisions across all parts of their financial life, not just one piece at a time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We truly offer comprehensive services. I bring a combination of academic training, real-world investment experience, and advisory work, with a focus on simplifying complexity. Clients shouldn’t feel overwhelmed by their finances—they should feel confident, informed, and supported by a clear strategy."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Getting to know what is most important to clients—what they most want to accomplish in their life—and helping them make that happen. Helping people move from uncertainty to clarity is incredibly rewarding."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I chose to work with Savvy to enhance the services and capabilities we offer our clients. Savvy provides stronger technology and operational support behind the scenes, which allows us to operate more efficiently and deliver a higher level of client service—while staying focused on what matters most: our clients and their goals."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Brandon Wyand, CFP®: Wealth Manager in Morrison, CO | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/brandon-wyand#connect-w-advisor","about":{"@type":"Person","name":"Brandon Wyand, CFP®","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/brandon-wyand#connect-w-advisor"},"isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6aa9abaa9ac2c3554ff4bcd8_Brandon%20Wyand-3-p-1080.png"},"datePublished":"2026-09-25T14:14:56.676Z","dateModified":"2026-09-25T14:14:56.676Z","description":"Brandon Wyand, CFP®, is a financial advisor in Morrison, CO, and founder of Out West Financial. He helps clients with tax, estate, and investment planning."},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","name":"Brandon Wyand","honorificSuffix":"CFP®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6aa9abaa9ac2c3554ff4bcd8_Brandon%20Wyand-3-p-1080.png","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/brandon-wyand#connect-w-advisor","email":"mailto:brandon.wyand@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"(303) 900-7359","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Morrison","addressRegion":"CO","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"Brandon Wyand is the Founder of Out West Financial and brings more than a decade of experience in wealth management. He earned his CFP® designation in 2018 and has held advisory roles at Compound Planning, Vanguard, Personal Capital, and Empower Advisory Group. He also obtained Series 63 and 65 licenses and graduated from Arizona State University with a degree in Business Entrepreneurship.

Entrepreneurship was part of Brandon’s life well before wealth management. He ran a successful eBay business through high school and college and purchased his first home in Old Town Scottsdale during his senior year. That entrepreneurial background continues to shape the practical, independent perspective he brings to his work today.

Now based in Morrison, Colorado, Brandon enjoys skiing, riding his Aprilia Tuono V4 1100RR, seeing live music at Red Rocks, and exploring Colorado with his wife and their three dogs.","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/brandon-wyand-cfp%C2%AE-a4163b4b"],"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"knowsAbout":["Tax Optimization","Estate & Trust Planning","Personal Direct Indexing","Financial Planning & Analysis"]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Brandon Wyand, CFP®","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/brandon-wyand#connect-w-advisor"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Mostly by chance. During my senior year at Arizona State University, my parents encouraged me to attend a career fair. I was on my way out when someone from AXA Advisors stopped me and introduced me to financial advising."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with people who want more freedom in their financial lives and value having someone they can talk to openly about money."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of experience do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My work centers on tax planning considerations, estate and trust planning, investment style and selection, and financial planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The strategy depends on the person. I help clients look at the financial choices available to them, understand the tradeoffs, and determine which direction fits their circumstances."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a different approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I don’t view investment management as the entire value of an advisory relationship. Investment tools are widely available. What technology cannot easily replicate is knowing a client well enough to recognize the concerns, preferences, and behaviors influencing a decision."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The people. The financial side of the work came naturally to me, but relationships are what made me want to stay in the profession."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Savvy gives me the autonomy to build my practice around the way I want to serve clients, while providing technology and resources that support the work behind the scenes."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"name":"Savvy Wealth","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"datePublished":"2026-06-12T14:13:55.824Z","primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6a1c71589165c2dad2792261_57526a24d783f54b35c4e9ebe10a3db6_Randy%20Long-2-p-500.png"},"@type":"WebPage","name":"Randy Long, CFP®: Wealth Manager in Wilmington, NC | Savvy Wealth","about":{"name":"Randy Long, CFP®","@type":"Person","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/randy-long"},"description":"Hi, I’m Randy. I work with business owners and their families to plan for retirement, estate and trust decisions, investment management, and business succession.","dateModified":"2026-06-12T14:13:55.824Z","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/randy-long"},{"contactPoint":[{"contactType":"Customer Service","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","areaServed":"US","@type":"ContactPoint","availableLanguage":["English"]}],"@type":"Organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"]},{"image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/6a1c71589165c2dad2792261_57526a24d783f54b35c4e9ebe10a3db6_Randy%20Long-2-p-500.png","address":{"addressCountry":"US","addressLocality":"Wilmington","addressRegion":"NC","@type":"PostalAddress"},"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning | Investment Management | Succession Planning | Estate & Trust Planning"],"@type":"Person","worksFor":{"name":"Savvy Wealth","@type":"Organization","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","description":"Randy M. Long is the Founder of Long Family Office and BuildProveSell.com companies, and the creator of the BulletProof Exit Process. He works with business owners who want to create enduring family legacies, prepare their businesses for sale, or transition ownership to the next generation.

With more than 39 years in wealth management and over 30 years across law and finance, Randy brings a wide-ranging background to his work with clients. He practiced law in estate planning and business transactions for 25 years, has managed family wealth for clients since 1987, and earned his Certified Financial Planner® designation from the University of Southern California.

Randy is also the author of BulletProof Your Exit and The BraveHeart Exit: 7 Steps to Creating Your Family Business Legacy. Outside of his advisory work, he has served as a trustee, board member, and consultant for national Christian nonprofits. He and his wife, Lydia, have raised five children while growing their own family businesses, giving him personal perspective on the balance between business success, family, and legacy.","telephone":"(910) 399 2748","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/randy-long","honorificSuffix":"CFP®","name":"Randy Long","email":"mailto:randy.long@savvyadvisors.com","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/randymlong1/"]},{"itemListElement":[{"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com","position":1,"@type":"ListItem"},{"name":"Randy Long","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/randy-long","position":2,"@type":"ListItem"}],"@type":"BreadcrumbList"},{"mainEntity":[{"name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I started working toward this path in college because I wanted to serve entrepreneurs. Early on, I thought becoming a CFP® professional was the best way to do that. After a few years, I realized business owners often need guidance that goes beyond personal financial planning, which led me to law school as well."}},{"name":"What types of clients do you work with?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I primarily work with business owners and their families. I look for client relationships where I can add meaningful value, and I prefer deep, long-term relationships with people who want thoughtful guidance over time."}},{"name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I combine legal training, exit planning, CFP® training, and investment management experience. That combination helps me look at client situations from multiple angles and connect personal, family, and business decisions into one planning conversation."}},{"name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My work includes estate planning, exit planning, investment management, and succession planning. I also bring a legal background and hands-on portfolio construction experience to the planning process."}},{"name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I often help clients with estate and trust planning, succession and exit planning, retirement planning, and investment management. Much of my work centers on helping business owners navigate complexity and think proactively."}},{"name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The clients themselves. I enjoy getting to know people well, building real relationships, and working closely with a smaller number of clients in a meaningful way."}},{"name":"Working with Savvy","@type":"Question","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I’ve appreciated the quality of the people at Savvy. I’ve been impressed with the team and the collaborative environment."}}],"@type":"FAQPage"}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","name":"Aaron Wiegman - Financial Advisor | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/aaron-wiegman","about":{"@type":"Person","name":"Aaron Wiegman","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/aaron-wiegman"},"isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/68272efcbc144353d7923f56_Aaron%20Hero%20(1).webp"},"datePublished":"2024-01-01","dateModified":"2024-06-01"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","name":"Aaron Wiegman","honorificSuffix":["CFP®"],"jobTitle":"Financial Advisor","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/68272efcbc144353d7923f56_Aaron%20Hero%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/aaron-wiegman","email":"mailto:aaron.wiegman@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"+1-858-321-3936","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Del Mar","addressRegion":"CA","addressCountry":"US"},"description":"Hello there 👋🏼 I'm Aaron, and I have over 20 years of experience as a financial advisor. My expertise lies in assisting clients with prioritizing their financial plans. I achieve this by effectively managing cash flow, optimizing savings, tracking expenses, maximizing earnings, allocating portfolios, ensuring tax efficiency, and implementing risk management strategies. By developing a comprehensive game plan that aligns with the client's values and goals, I foster open communication and strive to present complex concepts in a clear and understandable manner.","sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/aaronwiegman/"],"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},"knowsAbout":["Financial Planning","Investment Management","Tax Optimization","Estate Planning","Risk Management","Wealth Management","Business Succession Planning","Employee Equity Compensation","Retirement Planning"]},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Aaron Wiegman","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/aaron-wiegman"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"During my college years, I developed a keen interest in finance. It all started when I pursued an investment-related internship, which was made possible through an introduction by my college basketball coach, to a local referee that was a stockbroker by day. This internship, which began in my junior year, became a significant part of my journey as I learned the basics of the investment world through the lens of the operations and trading department within the brokerage. 

Once I moved to San Diego, I began my career working with clients as a financial advisor and helping them make smart choices with their money. Both of my parents and two of my siblings are teachers, and while I didn’t necessarily go that route, I like to take an educational approach with my clients, ensuring that my clients are equipped with the knowledge they need to navigate their financial endeavors."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I assist clients in prioritizing key elements of their financial plan, including managing cash flow, optimizing savings, tracking expenses, maximizing earnings, ensuring tax efficiency, diversifying tax strategies, allocating portfolios, and implementing risk management strategies.

Once I thoroughly understand the unique values and goals that are important to my clients, we can start crafting a comprehensive game plan that will align our planning efforts with their priorities. I like to be approachable and authentic, fostering open communication with my clients. I strive to explain complex financial concepts in a clear and understandable manner to ensure they have a solid grasp of their financial situation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach you take with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Many clients seek my assistance when their financial lives become increasingly complex, and they realize they need guidance. They are faced with numerous financial decisions - saving, investing, company benefits, insurance, retirement plans, taxes, estate planning, and more - and often feel unsure if these choices align with their overall goals of growing, protecting, and transferring their wealth. I help clients take a look at the big picture to help them align what matters to them with their financial decisions to help them achieve their goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's your favorite part about working with clients as a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Everyone comes from a different background, relationship with money, upbringing, values, goals, etc. I enjoy learning about their financial journey and being that trusted advisor to help them get to where they want to be. Financial planning decisions are unique for each client situation and I enjoy working with clients to help them solve the ever-changing puzzle."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I enjoy developing comprehensive financial plans for each client, tailoring strategies based on their unique priorities and goals. I believe in creating a holistic investment management approach, assisting clients with various aspects of their employee equity compensation, business succession planning, retirement plan decisions, tax-efficient savings and distribution strategies, insurance planning (life, disability, LTC), charitable giving, and estate planning. It’s never a one-size-fits-all all with my clients, everyone has different financial needs and we build a plan that we will be constantly updating and adjusting to reflect the goals and strategies that keep up with a client's ever-changing life."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I was looking for the right partner to work with that would have the tools and resources that would A) be the most helpful to the clients that I serve in helping them achieve their financial goals and B) support my efforts in growing a practice that allows me to be my authentic self.  Savvy gives me the opportunity to focus on my client relationships and help them achieve their financial goals and not spend my time and energy on systems, technology, and operations."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/zack-smith/#webpage","name":"Zack Smith: Wealth Manager in Macomb, MI | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/zack-smith","description":"Zack Smith is a Michigan-based financial advisor helping business owners and professionals build disciplined investment strategies, structured retirement plans, and risk-aware portfolios.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a9c89144f4783832e00be2_Zack%20S%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-03-09T16:17:02.836Z","dateModified":"2026-03-09T16:17:02.836Z","about":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/zack-smith/#person","name":"Zack Smith","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/zack-smith"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/zack-smith/#person","name":"Zack Smith","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69a9c8918386d452b2ee7f55_Zack%20S%20Hero%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/zack-smith","email":"mailto:zack.smith@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"+1-586-248-4122","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Macomb","addressRegion":"MI","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":[],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Investment Management","Risk Management","Alternative Investing"],"description":"Zack Smith is an Investment Adviser Representative based in Macomb, Michigan with 9 years of wealth management experience. He started his career as a high school teacher specializing in economics and political science, which shaped how he communicates complex topics in a clear, practical way.

Today, Zack works with business owners, professionals, and investors who value structure, long-term thinking, and a risk-aware approach to building wealth. His work often centers on asset allocation, portfolio construction, and retirement planning, including helping clients evaluate regulated digital asset exposure through cryptocurrency ETFs within a diversified portfolio.

Zack’s approach is rooted in education, transparency, and ongoing partnership. He aims to give clients a process they can understand, a plan they can follow, and a portfolio framework designed to adapt as markets and life evolve."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Zack Smith","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/zack-smith"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I started off as a high school teacher specializing in economics and political science. My passion and experience in both of these subjects paved my way to eventually becoming a financial advisor."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My ideal client is someone who is focused on the long-term outcome and growth of their investments and retirement savings. I often work with business owners, professionals, and investors who want a disciplined planning process."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Asset allocation and portfolio construction, cryptocurrency ETF strategy and digital asset exposure, and retirement and financial planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Strategic wealth building, tactical risk management, and cryptocurrency and digital asset integration when it fits the client’s goals and overall plan."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I use a disciplined, tactical framework that adapts to market environments. In bull markets, I often lean on low-cost, broad-market ETFs to capture efficient upside. In bear markets or higher-volatility periods, I may rotate into leveraged index and sector ETFs when risk-adjusted opportunities present themselves, with structured risk controls in place."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I find the greatest fulfillment in helping clients turn their retirement and investment goals into a structured, achievable plan for lasting financial security."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I value Savvy’s streamlined processes, organized team structure, and supportive culture. Their technology-driven platform creates a more efficient workflow for advisors and a more seamless, engaging experience for clients."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jonathon-merickel/#webpage","name":"Jonathon Merickel, CFP®: Wealth Manager in Chicago, IL | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jonathon-merickel","description":"Jonathon Merickel, CFP®, is a Savvy wealth manager in Chicago helping individuals, families, and business owners plan for retirement, taxes, and legacy goals.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69838df1f1487043fc799ba7_Jonathon%20Merickel%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-02-10T19:26:14.509Z","dateModified":"2026-02-10T19:26:14.509Z","about":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jonathon-merickel/#person","name":"Jonathon Merickel","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jonathon-merickel"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jonathon-merickel/#person","name":"Jonathon Merickel","honorificSuffix":"CFP®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69837e3ece5e986f200c37e9_Jonathon%20hero-p-500.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jonathon-merickel","email":"mailto:jonathon.merickel@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"+1-312-761-9110","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Chicago","addressRegion":"IL","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/jonathon-merickel-cfp%C2%AE-a362241/"],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Tax Optimization","Legacy & Charitable Planning","Financial Planning & Analysis"],"description":"I’ve always loved helping people accomplish their goals. Financial advising is unique in that it allows me to work with individuals and families across every stage of life, from early accumulation years to retirement and beyond.

Over the years, I’ve seen firsthand how life rarely goes exactly according to plan. That’s why I believe great financial planning must be flexible, personal, and grounded in real human experience. My role is to help clients navigate both planned milestones and unexpected changes with confidence and clarity.

In addition to working with clients, I’m actively involved in the financial planning community and currently serve as a Board Member of FPA Illinois, supporting the profession and its future."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Jonathon Merickel","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/jonathon-merickel"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I’ve always enjoyed helping people set goals and work toward achieving them. Financial advising allowed me to do exactly that, while also building long-term relationships with clients as they move through different stages of life. In my opinion, it's one of the few professions where you truly see the impact of your work over time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with accumulators, retirees, and business owners. My clients are often navigating important transitions - growing wealth, preparing for retirement, or managing life changes, and value having a trusted advisor by their side."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My expertise includes comprehensive financial planning, investment management, retirement planning, tax planning, and legacy and charitable strategies. I focus on helping clients align their finances with both short-term needs and long-term objectives."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients with investment management aligned with long-term goals, retirement planning and income strategy, tax planning and optimization, budgeting and cash flow management, and legacy and charitable planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I am firmly committed to the fiduciary standard and treat every client the same, regardless of net worth. Whether someone has $50,000 or $50 million, my responsibility is to provide thoughtful, objective advice that serves their best interests."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"This is one of the few careers where you get to work with people through all phases of life. I enjoy being there for both the milestones clients plan for and the unexpected moments life brings along the way."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The people at Savvy are incredibly special. From a technology and platform standpoint, I firmly believe the organization is well positioned for the next 20 years. Savvy’s forward-thinking approach allows advisors to focus on what matters most, clients and meaningful relationships."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/susan-jones/#webpage","name":"Susan Jones, J.D., CFP®, CDFA®: Wealth Manager in Boca Raton, FL | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/susan-jones","description":"Susan Jones, J.D., CFP®, CDFA® is a financial advisor at Savvy Wealth with 25+ years of experience, specializing in estate and trust planning, tax strategy, multi-generational wealth planning, and financial guidance through life transitions.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/68de529dca0cce8c0bf89265_Susan%20Jones%20hero-p-500.webp"},"datePublished":"2025-12-09T23:03:54.622Z","dateModified":"2025-12-09T23:03:54.622Z"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/susan-jones/#person","name":"Susan Jones","honorificSuffix":"J.D., CFP®, CDFA®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/68de529dca0cce8c0bf89265_Susan%20Jones%20hero-p-500.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/susan-jones","email":"mailto:susan.jones@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"+1-561-867-0987","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Boca Raton","addressRegion":"FL","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/susan-wofford-jones-j-d-cfp%C2%AE-cdfa%C2%AE-73942688/"],"knowsAbout":["Tax Optimization","Estate & Trust Planning","Financial Planning & Analysis","Investing for Women"],"description":"Susan brings 25 years of expertise in wealth management, estate planning, tax strategy, and multi-generational planning. She is especially known for guiding women through major life transitions including divorce, retirement, loss, and career change. With a background spanning tax law, private foundations, and high-net-worth advisory, Susan combines technical depth with a coaching mindset to help clients navigate emotional and financial complexity with clarity, confidence, and purpose.

Before co-founding Sorelle Wealth Partners, she practiced tax and estate law at an international law firm and later became a partner at a national accounting firm and shareholder at a Top 100 Registered Investment Advisory firm. Today, she blends rigorous analysis with empathetic guidance to help clients minimize taxes, protect assets, and build meaningful long-term financial strategies.

Originally from the Midwest, Susan now lives in Highland Beach, Florida with her husband, Scott, and their four children. Outside of work, she enjoys cooking and boating — though she’s still working on becoming a confident captain."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Susan Jones","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/susan-jones"}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/michael-gaynor/#webpage","name":"Michael Gaynor: Wealth Manager in Highlands Ranch, CO | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/michael-gaynor","description":"Michael Gaynor is a financial advisor at Savvy Wealth with 17+ years of experience as an options trader and deep expertise in 401(k)s, alternative investing, risk management, and holistic financial planning.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/68d69d6b20515e48e5b58e21_Michael%20Hero-p-500.webp"},"datePublished":"2025-12-09T22:39:40.505Z","dateModified":"2025-12-09T22:39:40.505Z"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/michael-gaynor/#person","name":"Michael Gaynor","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/68d69d6b20515e48e5b58e21_Michael%20Hero-p-500.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/michael-gaynor","telephone":"+1-720-823-5353","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Highlands Ranch","addressRegion":"CO","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/mike-gaynor-6b8151b0/"],"knowsAbout":["Alternative Investing","Financial Planning","Investment Management","Risk Management"],"description":"Mike has loved finance for as long as he can remember. After spending 17+ years as an independent market maker on the floor of the Chicago Board of Trade (CBOT), he transitioned into financial advising to help others navigate investing, risk, and long-term planning. At Savvy, he applies deep market knowledge, relationship-building skills, and a client-first mindset to guide individuals and families toward their financial goals.

His background includes small business ownership and extensive experience evaluating risk/reward dynamics. Mike holds a business degree from NIU and stays closely attuned to market conditions to better support his clients.

Outside the office, Mike is a husband, father, and active member of Red Rocks Church. A mission trip to Honduras deeply influenced his outlook on life and service. Originally from Chicago, he now lives in Highlands Ranch, CO, where he enjoys skiing, hiking, biking, pickleball, and cross-fit with his family."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Michael Gaynor","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/michael-gaynor"}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/patrick-conroy/#webpage","name":"Patrick Conroy: Wealth Manager in New York, NY | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/patrick-conroy","description":"Wealth advisor Patrick Conroy in New York offers personalized investment management, retirement planning, and financial strategies tailored to your goals.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69c40703b657c65755a848cc_Patrick%20C%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-03-25T17:30:33.511Z","dateModified":"2026-03-25T17:30:33.511Z","about":{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/patrick-conroy/#person","name":"Patrick Conroy","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/patrick-conroy"}},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/patrick-conroy/#person","name":"Patrick Conroy","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/69c406e1143c8e14c16f84e6_Patrick%20C%20Hero%20(1)-p-500.webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/patrick-conroy","email":"mailto:patrick.conroy@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"516-268-6076","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"New York","addressRegion":"NY","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/patrickdconroy/"],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Investment Management","Risk Management","Financial Planning & Analysis"],"description":"Patrick brings decades of perspective from across financial markets, trading, and wealth management. He began his career in financial services after graduating from Columbia University with a degree in Economics. Over the years, he held senior trading and leadership roles at firms including Merrill Lynch, Prudential, Credit Suisse, and Donaldson Lufkin Jenrette.

After spending much of his career on the institutional side, Patrick transitioned into advising because he wanted to work more directly with individuals and families, helping them connect day-to-day decisions with long-term goals. He supports clients with investment and risk management, retirement planning, and financial planning, with a focus on building portfolios thoughtfully while keeping an eye on risk and tax considerations.

Outside of work, Patrick is a lifelong learner with a deep interest in markets. He is married to his high school sweetheart, Karen, and they have four daughters, plus a grandchild, Finnegan. He enjoys skiing, golf, and keeping up with sports."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Patrick Conroy","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/patrick-conroy"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How did you become a financial advisor?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I’ve been in financial services since graduating with a degree in Economics from Columbia University. After two decades in institutional trading and management, I transitioned to the advisory side to help clients with investment and risk management, along with financial and retirement planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I work with business owners, executives, high net worth individuals, and mass affluent families."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I focus on asking the right questions and drilling down to the “why,” so we can identify goals that are personally meaningful and build a plan that supports them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Savvy removes many of the frictions advisors face, which allows for more client-facing time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"My work centers on investment management, risk assessment and management, and financial and retirement planning."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"I help clients build and maintain investment strategies with a focus on risk management and tax considerations, while keeping the plan aligned with their broader financial and retirement goals."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Helping clients live the best life possible with the assets they have available to them."}}]}]}

{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","name":"Savvy Wealth"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/chris-benda/#webpage","name":"Chris Benda, CIMA®, CPWA®: Wealth Manager in Des Moines, IA | Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/chris-benda","description":"Chris Benda is a Des Moines–based wealth advisor helping individuals and families align retirement, legacy, and financial planning with what truly matters.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#website"},"primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/697a41cf222d7886d382f930_Chris%20Benda%20SEO.webp"},"datePublished":"2026-02-03T20:59:21.638Z","dateModified":"2026-02-03T20:59:21.638Z"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization","name":"Savvy Wealth","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/647dd6624b8fd164bb0f9637_Savvy%20Logo.svg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/company/savvywealth","https://x.com/SavvyWealthInc"],"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","telephone":"+1-833-745-6789","contactType":"Customer Service","areaServed":"US","availableLanguage":["English"]}]},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/chris-benda/#person","name":"Chris Benda","honorificSuffix":"CIMA®, CPWA®","jobTitle":"Wealth Manager","image":"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6479cdbae84fd9792129c576/697a06632e92ec773597f55e_Chris%20Benda%20Hero%20(1)%20(1).webp","url":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/chris-benda","email":"mailto:chris.benda@savvyadvisors.com","telephone":"+1-515-220-2067","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","addressLocality":"Des Moines","addressRegion":"IA","addressCountry":"US"},"worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.savvywealth.com/#organization"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/chrisbenda/"],"knowsAbout":["Retirement Planning","Estate & Trust Planning","Succession Planning","Legacy & Charitable Planning"],"description":"My path to wealth management was shaped by real-world experience long before formal credentials. However, those formal credentials along with over 20 years of experience spearheaded my expertise and proficiency to work with high net worth individuals, families, and institutions.

I am a graduate of Texas Tech University and hold the Certified Investment Management Analyst® certification administered by the Investments and Wealth Institute and taught in conjunction with The Wharton School, University of Pennsylvania. CIMA certification is the peak international, technical portfolio construction program for investment consultants, financial advisors, and wealth management professionals, and it stands out among other financial certifications for its effective emphasis on the combination of theory and practical application.

In addition, I hold the Certified Private Wealth Advisor® designation taught in conjunction with the University of Chicago Booth School of Business. The CPWA program takes a holistic and multidisciplinary approach that includes a deep dive into sophisticated wealth strategies, estate planning, wealth transfer, behavioral finance, family dynamics, tax management, and legacy planning. CPWA® certified professionals are able to identify and analyze the unique challenges high-net-worth individuals face and understand how to develop specific strategies to minimize taxes, monetize and protect assets, maximize growth, and transfer wealth."},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Chris Benda","item":"https://www.savvywealth.com/advisor/chris-benda"}]},{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of clients do you work with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As Ray Kroc said: "When you're green, you're growing. When you're ripe, you rot." Chris took that to heart."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What areas of expertise do you have?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"They are not starting over. They are refining direction. While their lives may look accomplished on paper, they want greater clarity around what is meaningful and how to move forward with confidence and purpose. At Benda & Co., we meet clients at this pivotal moment—helping them clarify what matters most, align their resources accordingly, and step into the next phase of life with intention, confidence, and significance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What types of strategies do you usually help clients with?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We focus on integrating technical financial expertise with real-life considerations, helping clients navigate complexity while keeping decisions aligned with their long-term goals and values."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a unique approach that sets you apart?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"This includes building strategies and plans that are highly integrated into their overall life and legacy plan based upon each client's complex financial matters. Our work is not about one-size-fits-all solutions, but about intentional planning that reflects each client’s priorities."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is your favorite part about working with clients?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"This approach removes doubt, simplifies complexity, and replaces hesitation with clarity and confidence. By aligning resources with intention, we help clients choose purpose over inertia—so they can fully enjoy the life they’ve built today while shaping a future they’re proud of."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Working with Savvy","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our process brings clarity, simplifies complexity, and helps clients move from uncertainty to confident decision-making. The result is a financial life that feels intentional, empowering, and aligned with a deeper sense of purpose."}}]}]}
